{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39046","headline":"暑日题道边树 · 王毂","name":"暑日题道边树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火轮迸焰烧长空，浮埃扑面愁朦朦。\n羸童走马喘不进，忽逢碧树含清风。\n清风留我移时住，满地浓阴嬾前去。\n却叹人无及物功，不似团团道边树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王毂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}